**Summary:** This design has 9 critical/high severity threats, all stemming from accepting untrusted URLs inside a VPC. The SSRF variants (threats 1-5) are Critical - they allow immediate access to credentials and internal systems. Must implement URL validation, IP blocking, and redirect protection before any implementation.

